# Commands run by the launchd job com.hakios.demo (see com.hakios.demo.plist).
# Metal on Vulkan (an image built with METAL=vk; docs/metal-plan.md, "Metal on Vulkan"). First metal2vulkan's runtime on the guest's
# Vulkan driver through the C ABI the plug-in uses: m2v_test runs the bridge's self-test, three compute kernels and a triangle, and
# checks every number against the CPU, as tools/metal/mk-metal2vulkan.sh mac does on a Mac (its last line says whether all of it
# held). The driver is gfxstream's on the Pixel; on another device, the path HakiosMetal.icd names. Then what Metal itself makes of
# the plug-in: metal_test, with boot-arg metal=1, which shows the device to that program only.
/redwood/bin/m2v_test /redwood/lib/libhakios.vk.dylib /tmp/m2v /redwood/share/m2v_test.metallib
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 25
/redwood/bin/metal_test
